# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# Visual Studio files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userosscache
**/*.sln.docstates

# Test results
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage

# NuGet packages
**/packages/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg

# Database files
**/*.db
**/*.mdf
**/*.ldf

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Docker
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml

# Documentation
**/docs/
**/README.md

# Scripts (entrypoint.sh is needed, so we only exclude specific ones)
**/seed-database.*
**/*.ps1
# Note: entrypoint.sh must NOT be excluded - it's required for the container

